---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
const isPreview = import.meta.env.LFNYC_PRODUCTION_BUILD !== 'approved';
---

<Site
  title="Privacy"
  description="How this Little Fight NYC website handles information: no analytics or advertising cookies, no background form submissions, and an email draft you control."
>
  <article class="policy shell">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span>Privacy</span>
    </nav>
    <p class="label">Updated October 9, 2026</p>
    <h1>YOUR INFORMATION.</h1>
    <p>
      This notice describes this Little Fight NYC{' '}
      {isPreview ? 'design preview' : 'service website'}. You can also find the
      business at <a href="https://littlefightnyc.com">littlefightnyc.com</a>.
    </p>
    <h2>Visiting this website</h2>
    <p>
      This app does not load analytics, advertising pixels, third-party fonts or
      embedded social widgets. It does not set cookies or save contact details
      in browser storage. Netlify serves the pages and may process request
      information, such as an IP address and browser details, to deliver and
      protect the site. Read{' '}
      <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/">Netlify’s privacy policy</a>{' '}
      for its practices.
    </p>
    <h2>Preparing a message</h2>
    <p>
      The contact form creates an email draft inside your browser. Typing and
      preparing the draft do not send your details to us. Choosing “Open email
      draft” passes the draft to your email app. You decide whether to send it.
      Choosing “Copy message” copies it to your device’s clipboard.
    </p>
    <h2>Calling, texting or emailing</h2>
    <p>
      If you choose to contact us, your phone, messaging or email provider
      processes that communication. Send only the information needed to explain
      your request. Keep passwords, card details and other sensitive account
      information out of the message.
    </p>
    <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
    <p>
      Portfolio and source links take you to separate websites. Their own
      privacy notices and settings apply.
    </p>
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      Write to{' '}
      <a href="mailto:hello@littlefightnyc.com">hello@littlefightnyc.com</a>{' '}
      about this website or information you have sent to Little Fight NYC.
    </p>
  </article>
</Site>
